{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415800","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415800","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1041580001:1":{"text":"你手中的花朵很美丽。","source_cn":"你手中的花朵很美丽。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDA2862F82CDBF24D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1041580002:1":{"text":"请恕我冒昧，它们出自何处？或许可以作为我下一场演出的布景。","source_cn":"请恕我冒昧，它们出自何处？或许可以作为我下一场演出的布景。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2466AD6079356AB7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041580003:0":{"text":"这是我庄园内的永寂花。拿去吧，无需给我报酬。","source_cn":"这是我庄园内的永寂花。拿去吧，无需给我报酬。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF7EAD2671D10F529","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041580004:1":{"text":"除了我手中这一束，其他永寂花都会凋零。作为舞台布景来说，未必是一个好选择。","source_cn":"除了我手中这一束，其他永寂花都会凋零。作为舞台布景来说...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDEB74F33D97D3975","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041580005:1":{"text":"没关系。它们只会在合适的时刻登场，以最美好的姿态，为观众留下难忘的一幕。","source_cn":"没关系。它们只会在合适的时刻登场，以最美好的姿态，为观...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0B530396C4E0FD75","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041580006:1":{"text":"而这一幕，足以成为永恒。","source_cn":"而这一幕，足以成为永恒。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x33F34D5546D66765","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041580007:1":{"text":"所谓的永恒，不过是相对凡人有限的生命而言。","source_cn":"所谓的永恒，不过是相对凡人有限的生命而言。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFBC412A1124A9981","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041580008:1":{"text":"对亡灵来说，存在本身已经是一种永恒。而记忆存续的时间未必会比存在更久远。","source_cn":"对亡灵来说，存在本身已经是一种永恒。而记忆存续的时间未...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD945F8ED84C590E5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041580009:1":{"text":"或许。但至少于此刻的我而言，永恒是一种美好的延续。","source_cn":"或许。但至少于此刻的我而言，永恒是一种美好的延续。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF135766B2BA8F696","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041580010:1":{"text":"生命赐予我的时间太少，让我无法为舞台倾尽所有；而现在，我却拥有无穷无尽的时间，得以将作品打磨到极致。","source_cn":"生命赐予我的时间太少，让我无法为舞台倾尽所有；而现在，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBCCC5EF2CB7BE964","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041580011:1":{"text":"死亡赐予我新生，观众与舞台也从未